### Store Branding

All templates accept `storeName` and `storeLogo` props. The store's branding (logo URL, accent color, store name) comes from the commerce store settings table. The sender address uses the store's `contactEmail` field.

### Partner Name 6 Integration

All three methods accept optional `partnerConfig` and pass it through to `sendEmailOrThrow()`, which handles SMTP vs Resend routing (see `sendEmailWithPartnerBranding()` at line 119 of `lib/email/service.ts`).

