## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `order-confirmation-email.tsx` template created in `lib/email/templates/`
- [ ] `shipping-notification-email.tsx` template created in `lib/email/templates/`
- [ ] `refund-confirmation-email.tsx` template created in `lib/email/templates/`
- [ ] All templates follow exact React Email pattern from `organization-invitation-email.tsx`
- [ ] All templates accept store branding props (`storeName`, `storeLogo`)
- [ ] `sendOrderConfirmationEmail()` method added to `EmailService` class
- [ ] `sendShippingNotificationEmail()` method added to `EmailService` class
- [ ] `sendRefundConfirmationEmail()` method added to `EmailService` class
- [ ] All methods use dynamic import + `render()` + `sendEmailOrThrow()` pattern
- [ ] All methods accept optional `partnerConfig` for partner SMTP routing
- [ ] Props types exported from each template file
- [ ] Type imports added to top of `lib/email/service.ts` (lines 41-56 area)
- [ ] Order confirmation email includes guest tracking URL when applicable
- [ ] Order confirmation email includes items with images, totals, shipping address
- [ ] Shipping notification includes carrier, tracking number, tracking link
- [ ] Refund confirmation includes refund amount, reason, affected items
- [ ] All templates render correctly in both HTML and plaintext modes

## Implementation Steps

1. Create `lib/email/templates/order-confirmation-email.tsx` with props type + component
2. Create `lib/email/templates/shipping-notification-email.tsx` with props type + component
3. Create `lib/email/templates/refund-confirmation-email.tsx` with props type + component
4. Add type-only imports for all three props types to `lib/email/service.ts`
5. Add `sendOrderConfirmationEmail()` method to `EmailService` class
6. Add `sendShippingNotificationEmail()` method to `EmailService` class
7. Add `sendRefundConfirmationEmail()` method to `EmailService` class
8. Test all templates render in both HTML and plaintext modes
